# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT RUNTIME DATA OR SECRETS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A full SQLite backup of OpenFox's sessions.db contains the entire event log of
# every session, AND the `settings` table — which holds provider API keys in
# clear text (e.g. search.tavilyApiKey). One `git add -A` on such a file
# publishes every key you own.
backup/
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.pre-de-dup.bak
*.sha256

# OpenFox database and its side files
sessions.db
sessions.db-wal
sessions.db-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Session exports (may contain prompts, paths, code from private projects)
*.openfox-session.json

# Credentials
token
*.token
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials*
*.pem
*.key

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Documentation folder — deliberately NOT committed (excluded on request).
# The files stay on disk (docs/README.md, specs, incident analysis, runbook).
docs/*
